Architecture 

Cypress directly works inside the browser
Cypress built on node.js and comes packaged as npm modules
This enables cypress to listen and modify the browser behaviour at run time by manipulating DOM and altering Network requests and responses on the fly.

Cypress run on chrome , electron , Firefox , IE.

